  "sourceCorrection": [
    "Replace the hand-drawn 3x7 terrain-chunk rectangles with the original DAT 13, Gold sequence 65, frame 0 body and its independently aligned flag layer.",
    "Retain original 9x12 dimensions, signed (-3,-8) anchors, untinted body pixels and player-colored grayscale flag pixels.",
    "Record physical torso selectors in imported layer metadata and provenance, including border flag physical sequence 2.",
    "Put territory posts into the shared scene at y - mapHeight*10, equivalent to the reference getZ(-0.1,y) with z_per_y=1/(mapHeight*100).",
    "Require current sight. Land-only six-neighbor boundaries ignore neutral tiles, blocked landscape and out-of-map neighbors.",
    "Reuse player sprite composition and the existing 512-entry color cache, including replacement and disposal."
  ],
